1
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:13,153
Paper runs two ways: what you issue to
people, and what they have to hand you.

2
00:00:13,605 --> 00:00:20,850
Each kind is set up once: how often it is
needed, and whether it has to be signed.

3
00:00:21,308 --> 00:00:27,871
And who may see it. The clerk chasing
driving licences has no business in the

4
00:00:27,871 --> 00:00:28,553
payroll.

5
00:00:29,005 --> 00:00:35,442
Name nobody and it is open to everybody
who can see documents at all — which is the

6
00:00:35,442 --> 00:00:36,760
sensible default.

7
00:00:37,217 --> 00:00:43,394
What has been issued, and what is still
owed, is a register rather than a memory.

8
00:00:43,847 --> 00:00:47,005
Next: issuing one, and getting it signed.

